Third-party work
----------------

vendor/pja is PJA 0.9.8 (https://github.com/YadeWira/PJA, MIT, the same
author), unmodified, for the JPEG inside a JNG; vendor/pja/NOTICE has its own
third-party notes (IJG for arithmetic-coded JPEG, CharLS for JPEG-LS).
pas/ppablake3.pas and pas/ppacpu.pas are PJA's pjablake3 and pjacpu under
other names.

pas/ppazlib.pas is a port to FreePascal of the parts of zlib 1.3's
deflate.c and trees.c that decide deflate's choices (hash chains,
longest_match, deflate_fast, deflate_slow, deflate_rle, deflate_huff, and
_tr_flush_block with build_tree, gen_bitlen, scan_tree, send_tree and
build_bl_tree), so that PPA can tell a stream zlib wrote by its parameters.
