tools/zpaql/zpaqlc.py, zpaqlvm.py and test_zpaqlc.py are PJA's
(https://github.com/YadeWira/PJA, MIT, the same author) at its commit
114c395, unmodified and pinned: the zpaq-std codec's ZPAQL decoder
(pas/plugin/zpaql/) is compiled with them, and its bytecode must not
change once a codec is published. pas/plugin/zpaql/model.zl takes its
arithmetic decoder from PJA's pas/plugin/zpaql/pjadec.zl.
